>
  <h1>Get started<span class="ink-orange">.</span></h1>
  <p class="lead">
    skipr is <b>available now</b>: a lean path of terminal + Claude Code + harness + short guides.
    This page is for beginners. Follow the steps in order — you do not need to be a developer.
  </p>

  <nav class="toc" aria-label="On this page">
    <a href="#path">1. The novice path (do this first)</a>
    <a href="#next">2. What to do next</a>
    <a href="#grow">3. This grows with you</a>
